=== morseDR : MOdelling tools for Dose-Response ===

Version 0.1.3
==========

- Fix `priorPosterior()` failing on `BinaryFitTT` fits with no mortality in
  the control (model `loglogisticbinom_2`, i.e. no `d` parameter): the prior
  sampling no longer unconditionally references `d`-related bounds that only
  exist for `loglogisticbinom_3`.

Version 0.1.2
=============

- Fix typo for CRAN submission: add values to documentation

Version 0.1.1
=============

- Add gamma stochastic part in the Continuous analysis.


Version 0.1.0
=============

- Initial release.
